MdTestData.MdString:
@if(something.y == true)
**bold**
@endif

@if(something.y == true)
**bold**
@else
*italic*
@endif

@if(something.y == true)
**bold**
@else if(something.x == true)
***bold and italic***
@else
*italic*
@endif

